{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演「卜卜脆」的羅皓誼，近日去到韓國旅遊放鬆度假。她在社交平台上載了一輯旅遊花絮照片，並配文寫道：「🄻🄾🅅🄴 🅄 🅂🄴🄾🅄🄻 🄼🅄🄲🄷 🍁｜」，分享旅程中的好心情。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"22717ea2-1c2e-415f-bc77-77ce3e1904ae.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026T422wVqarC1792488392.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p></p><p>平時多以清純可愛路線示人的羅皓誼，今次造型令人眼前一亮。她特別穿上一襲米白色的露肩一字領上衣搭配短裙，穿梭於韓國當地的特色小店與咖啡館之間。她不時對着鏡頭擺出甜美甫士，大方展露迷人的鎖骨與香肩，散發出獨特魅力。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"b554b9c1-128f-4332-b3c6-d18b5a68e417.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026bMfCY6FMOs1792488391.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>今次激罕大騷小性感的新造型，打破了過往的清純印象，讓大批粉絲感到驚喜十足，紛紛圍觀讚好並留言激讚！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.936624+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T12:38:01.973290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:00.825781+00:00","content_hash":"bd996ad83c563a82da12cfa096fba3349085ba0ef6a548f6a4921d4b0b8c808a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}